  "markdown_content": "## Cast Update\\nShah Rukh Khan's upcoming film \"King\" has been generating significant buzz since its announcement last year. The film is particularly notable as it reunites SRK with Pathaan director Siddharth Anand and marks the theatrical debut of his daughter Suhana Khan, who recently made her OTT debut with The Archies.\\n\\n## New Addition\\nAccording to a report by Peeping Moon, Arshad Warsi has joined the cast in a pivotal role, though specific details about his character are being kept confidential. While Shah Rukh Khan and Arshad Warsi have been friends for years, this will be their first significant on-screen collaboration, apart from SRK's previous guest appearance in Warsi's 2005 film \"Kuchh Meetha Ho Jaye\".\\n\\n## Production Details\\nThe film is being produced under Khan's Red Chillies Entertainment and Siddharth Anand's Marflix Pictures. The cast also includes notable actors:\\n* Abhishek Bachchan\\n* Abhay Verma of \"Munjya\" fame",
